        <item>
            <title>1.0.8</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Every room in the menu at the top.</strong> Pick any HomePod, even if nothing is playing, to set its volume or press play to pick up where it left off.</li>
<li><strong>Help when no HomePods are found.</strong> If none show up, the app explains the usual causes and opens the right setting.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
