        <item>
            <title>1.0.7</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Instant album art when switching rooms.</strong> Artwork for every room that's playing is ready before you switch.</li>
<li><strong>Snappier controls.</strong> Play, pause and skip no longer wait while the app checks on your speakers.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
